aign has pulled back from the airwaves while trailing, and major Republican outside groups have paused or redirected their North Carolina spending. Expert raters broadly call the race Likely Democratic, with a few going further. The state's slight Republican tilt and the possibility of late movement keep this from being a lock, but the weight of polling, money, and spending patterns all point to Cooper as the clear favorite.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9425, "margin": 7.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.93, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9375, "margin": 8.2}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9346, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9264, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9322, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.939, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9386, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9577, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9512, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9379, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9381, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.956, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9414, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9393, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9452, "margin": 9.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 9.0}]}